{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211230","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121123001:1":{"text":"That sound... it's still lingering in my mind...","source_cn":"那种声音现在还在我耳朵里环绕不去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24FBAAF2B465942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121123001":{"text":"That sound... it's still lingering in my mind...","source_cn":"那种声音现在还在我耳朵里环绕不去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24FBAAF2B465942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121123002:1":{"text":"Are you here to investigate? Great!","source_cn":"你们是来调查的人吗？太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC13CB91C79660C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121123003:0":{"text":"I was sewing at home when I suddenly heard a <style=\"highlight\">rhythmic chanting</style> coming from outside the window.","source_cn":"我之前正在家里纺织缝纫，结果突然听到窗外传来一阵非常<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802EE81B4B8DAB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121123004:1":{"text":"But when I went to check, there wasn't anyone outside. Meanwhile, there was a commotion at the center of the plaza, with people saying that the statue was gone.","source_c